If I have it early and I find some magic armor/amulets, I'll polypile
to try for reflection or MR.  The life-saving value of that is a lot
higher than getting a ton more stuff later on when you're already
tanked up.  But that's rarely any reasonably heavy armor.

> Selling armor for cash is a lost cause when pet-thefting and
