> heavy crud around for pennies.

Grabbing a suit of mithril to sell can be faster and less boring, and
pets sometimes die.  they're easily replaced, but if you find an armor
shop or something early on it's not that unusual for it to be worth
dragging a few pieces of armor in to sell to get that cloak/gloves/
boots/etc rather than waiting to find a tameable pet.

